NAME
    unicli - cross-platform network & process CLI tool

SYNOPSIS
    unicli [--version] [--help] <command> [args]

DESCRIPTION
    unicli is a cross-platform CLI tool designed to query network and process
    information with minimal learning curve.

COMMANDS
    ip              Show local IP addresses
    port <port>     Check if a port is in use
    ps              List running processes
    conn            Show network connections
    connect <host>  Test connectivity to a host
    kill <pid>      Kill a process by PID

EXAMPLES
    unicli ip
    unicli port 8080
    unicli ps
    unicli connect 8.8.8.8
    unicli kill 1234

WEBSITE
    https://github.com/neko233-com/unicli